  "idea": "How to turn any website into a standalone desktop app on your computer",
  "text": "Stop keeping twenty pinned browser tabs open for apps like WhatsApp, Notion, or Trello. Your browser slows down, battery life drains fast, and you constantly misplace important conversations. Crowded tab bars force constant context switching and lead to accidentally closed work sessions. In Chrome or Edge, click the menu dots, select Save and Share, and click Install. You gain dedicated desktop icons with instant taskbar access.",
